\newlabel{tab:repeated-query-variance}{{VI}{8}{Repeated-query variability. MCV is the median coefficient of variation of predicted \rai across repeats (lower is steadier); Agr is the fraction of kernels with unanimous \bandwidthbound /\computebound predictions across repeats}{table.6}{}}
